#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A block theme for artists, galleries, collectives and publishers. It presents creators, works, collections and articles from the Galerio Core plugin, with layouts for each, translatable patterns a child theme can override one at a time, and colour and typography style variations. Requires the Galerio Core plugin."
